        }
      ],
      "message": "indexes: Save progress on early flushes\n\nConnectTip can flush the chainstate before sending BlockConnected.\nThe index skips saving its tip, so a pruned assumeutxo node can\ndelete blocks the index needs when it restarts.\n\nSave the index's current tip when the flushed block is ahead on\nthe same chain.\n\nFixes #36939",
      "committer": {
        "name": "Lakshya Bagani",
